  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Adaptation &amp; finance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will help mobilise domestic and international climate finance to enable Nepal to meet its ambitious climate targets and support climate adaptation initiatives in Nepal. It will include support for establishing a financing mechanism for mainstreaming climate change into regular planning, budgeting and budget execution.</narrative>
  </description>
